docs {
  ## Generate Signed Upload URL — Missing Fields

  Tests generating upload URL with an empty files array.

  ### Expected Error Response (400)
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "error": "R2_SIGNED_URLS_BAD_REQUEST"
  }
  ```
}
